{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-retractedWalkway-6000": "ENGINEER: 最后一段走道收回去了！主管呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-retractedWalkway-6001": "ENGINEER: 什么叫不知道！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-radioKill-6002": "NIKOLAI: 我们来这里干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-radioKill-6003": "ALEXANDRA: 我想，从这里能启动下面的通道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-radioKill-6004": "ALEXANDRA: 还有船坞大门……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-radioKill-6005": "ALEXANDRA: 这里还能让无线电发射机的电源过载。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-radioKill-6006": "ALEXANDRA: 说真的，他们的防护得加强了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-radioKill-6007": "NIKOLAI: 行啊，小姑娘。你怎么会这么多本事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-radioKill-6008": "ALEXANDRA: 靠电线里的铜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-radioKill-6009": "ALEXANDRA: 我能听见它……也能感觉到它。所以我知道，这些线路都通向哪里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-radioKill-6010": "NIKOLAI: 能给我们争取些逃跑的时间。走！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-dockJumpBattle-6011": "ENGINEER: 主管！这里需要您！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-dockJumpBattle-6012": "ENGINEER: 想上这艘飞空艇？做梦！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-dockJumpBattle-6013": "ENGINEER: 攻击！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileLeap-6014": "跳过去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileLeap-6015": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileLeap-6016": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6017": "这东西真能飞了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6018": "CHIEF: 不是叫你们这帮蠢货别来烦我吗！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6019": "CHIEF: 指挥部还指望我们凭空变出第二支舰队。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6020": "CHIEF: 卢斯基亚那边还陷着呢，怎么又要去打另一个国家……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6021": "CHIEF: 依我看，上头就是专门跟我们工程部队过不去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6022": "NIKOLAI: 嘿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6023": "CHIEF: 该死，刚不是说——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6024": "CHIEF: 哦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6025": "CHIEF: 我……是不是错过了很多事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6026": "NIKOLAI: 你说的入侵，是怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6027": "CHIEF: 什么都不会告诉你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6028": "NIKOLAI: 你会后悔这么说的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6029": "CHIEF: 你这种乡下小子我带过一百个，你不会动我的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6030": "NIKOLAI: 没错，可他们就不一定了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6031": "CORDELIA: 我知道一道能提取隐藏思想的法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6032": "CORDELIA: 不过，需要把大脑从身体里分离出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6033": "NIKOLAI: 现在呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6034": "CHIEF: 她相当有说服力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6035": "JEROME: 什么入侵？他们要去哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6036": "CHIEF: 舰队在卢斯基亚受阻了，所以冯·罗尔说服总理，让他带一半的船改向西进。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6037": "CHIEF: 他们要进攻一座外国城市，据说那里有种很先进的魔力源。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6038": "CORDELIA: 那只能是莱奥尼亚，难道他们的目标是迪亚孔？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6039": "JEROME: 他们出发多久了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6040": "CHIEF: 昨天出发的，现在大概已经到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6041": "NIKOLAI: 把他绑起来，扔回码头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6042": "JEROME: 能帮我们让船飞起来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6043": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……应该能？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6044": "CORDELIA: 她当然能。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-hostileBoarding-6045": "CORDELIA: 不过，必须快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-needCatwalk-6046": "ALEXANDRA: 这段走道的控制面板，应该就在这一层的某个地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-airToLogos-6047": "AGATA: 现在怎么办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-airToLogos-6048": "CORDELIA: 通往我们世界的门，大致在哪里，我心里有数。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-airToLogos-6049": "NIKOLAI: 得赶快冲过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-airToLogos-6050": "NIKOLAI: 不过，只要他们没法提前发报，我们就应该能赶在守军得到消息前，抵达那道门。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-airToLogos-6051": "AGATA: 舰队呢？你相信他的话？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-airToLogos-6052": "NIKOLAI: 信。冯·罗尔那家伙是个疯子。什么事、什么人，他都敢下手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-airToLogos-6053": "NIKOLAI: 你们国家有什么防御手段？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-airToLogos-6054": "JEROME: 对付飞空舰队？几乎没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-airToLogos-6055": "CORDELIA: 我们整个文明都建立在魔法之上。我国的人们绝不会就这样放弃抵抗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-airToLogos-6056": "CORDELIA: 等我们赶到，欠缺的那份力量，自会由我们补上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-reinforcedDoorWest-6057": "ALEXANDRA: 太结实了。要拆掉，得花好几个小时。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6058": "回去报告？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6059": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6060": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6061": "AGATA: 我回去看过山口，没发现有人追来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6062": "JEROME: 多谢。看来那些野蛮人追得也不怎么上心，倒是件好事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6063": "AGATA: 他们在替谁办事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6064": "AGATA: 那支军队，我们在那些……姑且叫幻象吧……里面见过几次。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6065": "JEROME: 来自尼古拉的国家。他以前是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6066": "JEROME: 还是让他自己说吧。那支军队，做得出非常可怕的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6067": "AGATA: 他们想达成什么目的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6068": "JEROME: 细节还不太清楚，不过他们正在打一场极其惨烈的战争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6069": "JEROME: 最大的优势，是一支在我国制造的飞空舰队。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6070": "AGATA: 飞空艇？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-agataReport-6071": "CORDELIA: 是的。等大家回来，我会解释。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benCampReturn-6072": "BEN: （虽说不是鳟鱼，但愿做出来还行……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6073": "问问这家伙在做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6074": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6075": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6076": "BEN: 哇！这里还有别人会做饭？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6077": "NIKOLAI: 算不上做饭，就是点薄饼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6078": "NIKOLAI: 巡逻时我们常做这种饼，再把手头有的口粮铺在上面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6079": "NIKOLAI: 一般是罐头香肠，或者果酱、黄油。可我带的这些，现在差不多全吃光了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6080": "BEN: 嗯……我看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6081": "BEN: 好，来点油，再放些刚采的野蒜、欧芹……还有这些洋葱……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6082": "BEN: 这鱼大概要先单独做一下……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6083": "BEN: 还有上回在商镇买的山羊奶酪……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-benAndNiko-6084": "NIKOLAI: 我怎么到现在才遇见你？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexReturnFire-6085": "ALEXANDRA: （荒郊野外也得走一英里，才找得到没人的地方……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexWithJunaFire-6086": "跟朱娜待一会儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexWithJunaFire-6087": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexWithJunaFire-6088": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexWithJunaFire-6089": "ALEXANDRA: 下个地方是哪儿都行，只要有自来水。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexWithJunaFire-6090": "JUNA: 我在野地里方便了二十多年，习惯就好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexWithJunaFire-6091": "JUNA: 不过，在动物园那会儿，他们给我睡的倒是一个又厚又软的大垫子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexWithJunaFire-6092": "JUNA: 那个垫子，我还真挺想念的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexWithJunaFire-6093": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，那位讲究的女士好像要说话了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6094": "CORDELIA: 请各位听一下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6095": "CORDELIA: 按凯劳诺斯的指示，我们正返回我的国家。我的世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6096": "CORDELIA: 奥斯伦帝国取得了我国的军事技术，正借此进行一场灭绝战争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6097": "CORDELIA: 几乎可以肯定，只要切断替换零件的供应，那些装备很快就会失去作用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6098": "CORDELIA: 为此，普罗赫，以及其他自觉有道义责任的人，必须到莱奥尼亚议会作证。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6099": "CORDELIA: 如此一来，就能叫停这类装备的制造和运输。不久之后，战争也就能结束了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6100": "BEN: 等等，给我再捋一遍。是你们政府在造这些东西？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6101": "JEROME: 是，秘密制造。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6102": "BEN: 没错。所以我们一到，就嚷嚷着知道了政府的肮脏秘密，你猜会怎样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6103": "BEN: 要多久，我们就会被装进袋子，沉到河底？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6104": "CORDELIA: 第一，我倒想看看他们敢不敢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6105": "CORDELIA: 第二，议会中有反对党。我们会向他们陈情。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6106": "NIKOLAI: 等等，本说得也有道理吧？政党的事，我懂得不多，可……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6107": "ALEXANDRA: （我……觉得自己不该在这里。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6108": "JUNA: （什么意思？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6109": "ALEXANDRA: （这些事，我全不懂。跟过来，只是因为那位厉害的女士能吓退幽灵。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6110": "ALEXANDRA: （或者说，一直追着我的那个东西。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6111": "ALEXANDRA: （哥哥害我成了通缉犯。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6112": "ALEXANDRA: （我甚至不知道，妈妈现在是不是还活着。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6113": "CORDELIA: 我觉得，你还没有意识到这件事的分量。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6114": "BEN: 女士，讲到分量，可没人比胖子体会更深。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6115": "BEN: 不过，我也不记得选过你当流浪冒险者俱乐部主席。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6116": "CORDELIA: 我只是遵从大贤者的指示。提醒你一句，他可来自你的世界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6117": "ALEXANDRA: （她是怎么回事，你觉得呢？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6118": "JUNA: （科黛莉娅？我认识的人类不多，不过兽医们总爱拿自己的“学识”来指挥别人。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6119": "ALEXANDRA: （可她怎么总是……那么不高兴？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6120": "JUNA: （嗯？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6121": "ALEXANDRA: （同行的那个男人，是我见过最帅的。还是医生，又是间谍？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6122": "ALEXANDRA: （他明明爱着她，可她好像根本没留意。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6123": "JUNA: （这我可不敢说。她几乎从不离开他身边，而且我们都知道，那可不是因为她缺乏自信。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6124": "JUNA: （也许，只是在感情上没那么有把握。她那样的人，连别人爱她的理由，都希望由自己掌控。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6125": "JUNA: （可感情的事，偏偏由不得自己这么安排。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6126": "ALEXANDRA: （什么？你难道还写情感专栏？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6127": "JUNA: （我是群居动物。大家总爱管彼此的事。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6128": "JUNA: （哦，她过来了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6129": "CORDELIA: 听说药膏和其他一些物品，由你携带？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6130": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，是。就在背包里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6131": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，呃，好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6132": "CORDELIA: 这里面，少说装了四百磅的装备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6133": "ALEXANDRA: 什么？怎么可能。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6134": "CORDELIA: 好姑娘，你给背包施了收纳法术。而且，相当高明。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6135": "CORDELIA: 我还注意到，你走在石面或天然地面上，脚步没有一点声音。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6136": "CORDELIA: 你们的世界，真没有魔法教育？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6137": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……没有？我在技校学过一年机械维修。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6138": "CORDELIA: 那你真是天赋出众。能与你相识，我很高兴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6139": "CORDELIA: 啊，失陪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6140": "JUNA: 亚历，帮我弄明白一件事。你现在这样……是不是叫“脸红”？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-cordeliaFireSpeech-6141": "ALEXANDRA: 就你话多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-campfireBombing-6142": "JEROME: 想睡的话就去吧，我还要再守半小时。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-campfireBombing-6143": "NIKOLAI: 不对劲。鸟和蟋蟀都不叫了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-campfireBombing-6144": "JEROME: 营地外围布了两层警戒法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-campfireBombing-6145": "NIKOLAI: 我猜也是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-campfireBombing-6146": "JEROME: 听见了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-campfireBombing-6147": "NIKOLAI: 没有，我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-campfireBombing-6148": "NIKOLAI: 所有人进树林！快！快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-campfireBombing-6149": "CORDELIA: 怎么——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAwakening-6150": "ALEXANDRA: 有本事就拦住我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAwakening-6151": "亚历珊德拉学会了“钢铁意志”！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-alexAwakening-6152": "ALEXANDRA: 对！我……呃，我本来就是这么打算的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-breakoutBoss-6153": "IMPERIAL OFFICER: 到此为止了，普罗赫！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-barbarianBattleLose-6154": "ALEXANDRA: 我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-imperialBattleIronResolve-6155": "ALEXANDRA: 试试这招！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-chapter9End-6156": "要保存游戏吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-chapter9End-6157": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-chapter9End-6158": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-startCampfireQuestion-6159": "在这里扎营过夜？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-startCampfireQuestion-6160": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-startCampfireQuestion-6161": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-leaveFromWestCampFire-6162": "BEN: 大家得吃饭，我该去做饭了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-leaveFromWestCampFire-6163": "ALEXANDRA: 还是跟大家待在一起吧……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-leaveFromWestCampFire-6164": "AGATA: 正在扎营，先留在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-leaveFromSouthCampFire-6165": "BEN: 大家得吃饭，我该去做饭了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-leaveFromSouthCampFire-6166": "ALEXANDRA: 还是跟大家待在一起吧……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter9/chapter9scenes.yarn-leaveFromSouthCampFire-6167": "AGATA: 正在扎营，先留在这里。"
}
